-- Unresolvable query (fails before the view): the access check cannot run, so the view body must not be revealed to anyone
outsider: OK, view body not revealed
full: OK, view body not revealed
-- Unresolvable projection: the outsider is denied while resolving the INVOKER view itself; the full user gets the unexpanded fallback
outsider: ACCESS_DENIED
full: OK, view body not revealed
-- Resolvable query: the access check runs; the view body is revealed exactly to those who may read the view
outsider: ACCESS_DENIED
full: OK, view body revealed
